# Amazon: the colour swatches under a result are inline links around block squares, 0x0 themselves, and were never reached.
# Starts on the "See options" link above them, in the first result that has swatches; what else a result shows changes from day to day.
https://www.amazon.com/s?k=headphones
start:css=[data-component-type=s-search-result]:has(a[aria-current]) a[id$=-announce]
key:ArrowDown
expect:css=[data-component-type=s-search-result] a[aria-current]
